ent-DisposalHolder = 廢棄物收納架 | disposal holder
    .desc = { "" }
ent-DisposalPipeBroken = 破損的廢水排放管 | broken disposal pipe
    .desc = 一條 BBP（大型破裂水管）。 | A BBP (big broken pipe).
ent-DisposalPipe = 排放管段 | disposal pipe segment
    .desc = 一段用於建造廢棄物處理系統的巨型管段。 | A huge pipe segment used for constructing disposal systems.
ent-DisposalTagger = 廢水管道標記器 | disposal pipe tagger
