ent-DisposalRouter = 廢棄路由器 | disposal router
    .desc = 一個三向路由器。標籤相符的實體會透過可配置的篩選器被路由至側邊。 | A three-way router. Entities with matching tags get routed to the side via configurable filters.
ent-DisposalRouterFlipped = { ent-DisposalRouter }
