ent-DisposalXJunction = 廢棄物 X 型交匯處 | disposal x-junction
    .desc = 一個四岔路口。箭頭標示物品的出口位置。 | A four-way junction. The arrow indicates where items exit.
ent-DisposalBend = 排放彎管 | disposal bend
    .desc = 一根彎曲成 90 度角的管子。 | A tube bent at a 90 degree angle.
ent-DisposalSignalRouter = 廢棄訊號路由器 | disposal signal router
    .desc = 一個由訊號控制的三向路由器。 | A signal-controlled three-way router.
